    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Scalar value type for a <ref refid="classRangeMap" kindref="compound">RangeMap</ref>. Values can be merged if they compare equal; splitting a value is done by copying it. The <ref refid="classRangeMapNumeric_1a45b803ad218f66ba6293b53a5b40b18d" kindref="member">removing()</ref> and <ref refid="classRangeMapNumeric_1a67d720ddddebf50277b3d12b07c28be0" kindref="member">truncate()</ref> methods are no-ops. See the <ref refid="classRangeMapVoid" kindref="compound">RangeMapVoid</ref> class for full documentation. </para>    </detaileddescription>
